<title>BELGIUM: Sibeka swings to 1996 loss of 125 mln Bfr.</title>
<headline>Sibeka swings to 1996 loss of 125 mln Bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit (less minorities)   loss 125 vs profit  594</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)				 9.707 vs	 9.314</p>
<p>    Operating profit				  105 vs	   400</p>
<p>    Current profit				    264 vs	   690</p>
<p>    Extraordinary loss				316 vs	    26</p>
<p>    Net dividend				     none vs	   175</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian industrial diamond group Sibeka SA is 54 percent owned by Belgian non-ferrous metals group Union Miniere.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
